{"t":1794362224075,"type":"say","kind":"question","why":"The reply asks the user for information and waits: the sale details (product, discount, end date) and whether the man in the photo is the user or someone who agreed. It makes no result and no tool call.","called":false,"text":"Happy to make this! I can turn the photo into a video where he speaks your sale message. Before I start, I need a few details so I don't make anything up:\n\n1. **What's the sale?** Your business or product name, the discount (for example \"30% off everything\"), and when it ends.\n2. **Is the man in the photo you, or someone who agreed to this?** I can only animate a real person's face with their permission.\n\nOne thing to know about your free plan: the simplest option makes a **5-second** clip, which fits about one short sentence (around 12 words). For example: *\"Our big sale is on now — 30% off everything, this week only!\"*\n\nIf you want something longer, I can make a voiceover first and have the photo speak it. Just tell me what you want him to say."}
